# sample-output — a real run of `board.py`, committed

This folder is a genuine output of this slice, committed so you can read the
exact shapes without running anything. It was produced on 2026-09-10 by:

    python3 demo/board/board.py seed demo/board/tmp/live-board.json
    python3 demo/board/board.py run  demo/board/tmp/live-board.json

| File | What it shows |
|---|---|
| `01-seeded-board.json` | the board as dispatched: 5 queued jobs |
| `report.txt` | the persisted one-line report (3 OK / 2 FAIL) |
| `journal.log` | the append-only audit trail of every transition |
| `archive-example-job-001.json` | one archived job record after the run |

`run` also writes per-job evidence (full stdout/stderr) under
`artifacts/<run-id>/` next to the board; that output is gitignored because it is
recreated on every run. This folder is the readable reference copy. It was
generated by the tool itself — not hand-edited to look good.
